# DO NOT COMMIT THIS
# Fixed-scope org:ci Organization Token used for build/update source-map uploads.
# Upload-only: never use this value for Sentry issue/event API investigation.
# Keep any read-only investigation token in a secure machine-level environment instead.
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=

# Reusable cross-fork setup:sentry credential from a configurable Internal Integration.
# Requires Organization Read, Team Admin, and Project Read & Write. Team Admin is
# needed when the organization disables member project creation. Prefer providing
# this from a secure machine-level environment: .env.local is included in EAS build
# archives by this template, so never leave the setup token here when building.
SENTRY_SETUP_AUTH_TOKEN=

# Optional override for the organization in the Sentry Expo plugin configuration.
# SENTRY_ORG=

# Set only when the Sentry organization has more than one team.
# SENTRY_TEAM=

# Set only for self-hosted Sentry. Defaults to https://sentry.io/.
# SENTRY_URL=
